      "content": "The overlay remains a single-column layout at every viewport width. Its body has no responsive layout rules, and the existing ReplayFrame stylesheet also leaves the plot and readout as sequential blocks, so the wide-screen layout required by A275 (charts left, readout right, full-width content below) is never applied. Add overlay-scoped wide-screen grid rules for the frame's content, retaining the stacked layout on phones without changing/remounting the frame.",
