      "content": "Filter this list to actual tabbable elements before choosing the trap boundaries. The selector also matches hidden inputs, controls in hidden/inert containers, and native controls with `tabindex=\"-1\"`. For example, if children end with a hidden input, the last visible button is never considered the edge, so Tab follows the browser's default navigation out of the dialog rather than wrapping to Close. Add coverage with hidden/inert trailing controls and negative-tabindex controls in addition to the visible-button case.",
